{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然才第一天，但至少今天的考試結束了。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "同學們的表情都顯得輕鬆了一些。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們也是一樣。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃考得怎麼樣？」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還可以，應該沒問題。」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk3431", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是妳。」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也沒有喔，其實在邊緣徘徊。」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk3432", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以實際上是？」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該不會被愛理罵。」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk3433", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「聽到這個我就安心了。」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格呢？」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk3434", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟櫻乃一樣吧。」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊唔唔～好羨慕你們兩位～」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ag3592", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔妳……從這個表情來看，好像不用問了。」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「神明一定是討厭女僕呢！」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ag3593", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以沒有對安潔微笑。」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ag3594", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為妳沒有盡人事吧。」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 229, "voice": "sn2194", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「盡力了喔，幾乎燃燒殆盡了。」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ag3595", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「上次不是勉強及格了嗎？」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 232, "voice": "ht1146", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。這次真的是相當極限，在結果出來之前一秒都不能放鬆的感覺！」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ag3596", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的結果應該在停筆那一刻就決定了吧……", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還是轉換一下心情，準備明天的考試比較好。」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，心情是很重要的。」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 229, "voice": "sn2195", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「光是想像瓜生趴在地上輸給我的模樣，就能提振精神用功。」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 229, "voice": "sn2196", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳是想著那種事念書的啊……」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格也練習一下趴地吧？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk3435", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為了不要那樣，明天也會加油的。」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔、安潔已經……想出發到遠方旅行了！」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ag3597", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那樣的話，回來還要補考。」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk3436", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「囧！說的也是。安潔，果然還是現在開始努力！」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ag3598", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對啊，明天也……」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然感覺到被注視。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我若無其事地往那個方向看去，有好幾個女孩子正看著我們這邊。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……是不認識的人。", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎麼回事？", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好奇……雖然有這種感覺，不過好像有點奇怪。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且她們是看著我……跟櫻乃？", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，妳認識那些女孩子嗎？」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，不認識。」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk3437", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一發現我們注意到，女孩們就慌張地跑掉了。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 232, "voice": "ht1147", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……沒什麼。」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我輕輕搖頭。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那些女孩們離去前的表情，感覺笑得有點陰狠……", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是我想太多了吧。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，在擔心考試？」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk3438", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，因為才剛開始。」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我摸摸她的頭。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，但是一定沒問題。」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk3439", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我點點頭，但還是有點在意。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為什麼呢？", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然跟合併試辦剛開始時不太一樣──", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我覺得學校的空氣又變得混濁。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
